 "text": "There are four months left in 2026. Think back to January. How many of the things you meant to do have you actually done? For most people the honest answer is not many, not because you stopped caring, because it stayed in your head and nothing in your head has a date on it. A plan you never wrote down is not a plan, it is a mood. So get it out, write the thing down, then move on it one day at a time and log what you did, because seeing the record build is what keeps you going. That is what Demure is for. Phase one is live today. Write your dream down, dated, public, permanent. Phase two starts shortly. That is the part that helps you actually get there. The archive is live at www.demure.com",
